07. PROJECT DOCUMENTATION

Project Title

LegalEaseAI – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

1. Introduction

Project documentation provides complete information about the LegalEaseAI project. It explains the problem, objectives, requirements, design, development, testing, and final outcome.

2. Project Overview

LegalEaseAI is an AI-powered application designed to help users generate structured legal document drafts based on their requirements.

3. Problem Statement

Preparing legal documents manually can require considerable time and knowledge of document formats. Users may find it difficult to prepare a properly structured document.

4. Proposed Solution

LegalEaseAI uses Generative AI to generate structured legal document drafts from user-provided information.

5. Objectives

1. Simplify document generation.
2. Save time.
3. Provide a user-friendly application.
4. Use Generative AI for document generation.
5. Generate structured document drafts.

6. Technologies Used

1. Python
2. FastAPI
3. Jinja2
4. HTML
5. CSS
6. Generative AI
7. GitHub

