8. Implementation

The application is implemented using Python and FastAPI. Jinja2 is used for dynamic templates. The Generative AI model processes the user's requirements and generates the requested document.

9. Testing

The application is tested using different test cases, including valid input, invalid input, empty input, document generation, result display, and download functionality.

